WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.179 --> 00:00:03.508
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good afternoon. How can I help you?

2
00:00:03.643 --> 00:00:07.480
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hello. I have a reservation for two nights.

3
00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.047
<v><b>A:</b></v> Your name?

4
00:00:09.137 --> 00:00:10.152
<v><b>B:</b></v> Carter.

5
00:00:11.137 --> 00:00:15.452
<v><b>A:</b></v> Carter. Here we are. Can you sign here, please?

6
00:00:15.989 --> 00:00:21.409
Here’s your key card. You’re in room two twelve, on the second floor.